    "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"column1-unit\"\u003e\n\n\u003c!--  信件內容   --\u003e\n\u003cpre\u003e分類： 其他公告\n來源： 學務處畢業生及校友服務組 - 溫小姐 - fengting0804@gms.ndhu.edu.tw - 電話6282\n對象： 全校教職員_全校學生\n標題： ✨點亮校園塔樓燈光~祝福畢業生前途光明似錦✨✨Light up the campus tower~Wish the graduates a bright future✨\n日期： Sun, 18 May 2025 17:31:04 +0800\n附檔： \u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E4%BA%BA%E7%A4%BE%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e人社一、二館.jpg\u003c/a\u003e (107 KB)   \u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E7%90%86%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%80%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e理工一館.jpg\u003c/a\u003e (86 KB)   \u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e圖書館.jpg\u003c/a\u003e (142 KB)   \u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E5%A1%94%E6%A8%93%E7%87%88.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e塔樓燈.jpg\u003c/a\u003e (44 KB)   \u003c/pre\u003e\u003chr class=\"clear-contentunit\"/\u003e\u003cpre\u003e📣畢業典禮本周六登場~~~\n為慶賀🎉113學年度畢業生順利畢業，學校秉承以往傳統於5/16~5/24夜間開始點亮壽豐校區塔樓燈，透過溫暖的塔樓之光，衷心祝福畢業生前途光明似錦，學成東華、鵬展天下~\n點亮塔樓燈，讓夜間靜謐的校園更添美麗，歡迎師生們可趁著畢業典禮前夕拍下夜晚塔樓點燈的美麗校景與大家分享。\n\n📣The graduation ceremony will be held this Saturday~~~\nTo celebrate the graduation of the 113th academic year graduates, the school adheres to the tradition and starts to light up the tower lights of the Shoufeng Campus. \nThrough the warm light of the tower, we sincerely wish the graduates a bright future, study in Donghua, and flourish in the world.\n\nLight up the tower lights to make the quiet campus more beautiful at night. \nTeachers and students are welcome to take advantage of the eve of the graduation ceremony to take pictures of the beautiful campus scene with the tower lights up at night to share with everyone.\n\n\u003c/pre\u003e\u003chr/\u003ejpg、png、gif、pdf 附檔縮圖（pdf 只顯示第一頁）：\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-right:20px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E4%BA%BA%E7%A4%BE%E4%B8%80%E3%80%81%E4%BA%8C%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"./thumb/1747560664_人社一、二館.jpg\"/\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e人社一、二館.jpg\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-right:20px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E7%90%86%E5%B7%A5%E4%B8%80%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"./thumb/1747560664_理工一館.jpg\"/\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e理工一館.jpg\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-right:20px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E5%9C%96%E6%9B%B8%E9%A4%A8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"./thumb/1747560664_圖書館.jpg\"/\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e圖書館.jpg\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;display:inline-block;margin-right:20px;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"./message_8/1747560664/%E5%A1%94%E6%A8%93%E7%87%88.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"./thumb/1747560664_塔樓燈.jpg\"/\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e塔樓燈.jpg\u003c/div\u003e\n\t\t\n\u003c/div\u003e",
